{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0161","paragraphs":[{"id":"p625114954f6d-1","text":"一向年光有限身。"},{"id":"p8948885fda1a-1","text":"等闲离别易消魂。"},{"id":"pc67a11b4d216-1","text":"酒筵歌席莫辞频。"},{"id":"pefad8b83ec74-1","text":"满目山河空念远，落花风雨更伤春。"},{"id":"p3af52d2c38c0-1","text":"不如怜取眼前人。"}]}